    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grapple, swing, and soar through A Monkey's Adventure! </strong>Master fluid 3D platforming, battle colossal bosses, and customize your monkey with unique powers and stylish gear. Take on the adventure solo or team up with up to three friends for chaotic online co-op!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM UP FOR ADVENTURE (1-4 ONLINE CO-OP)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your team! Jump into seamless <strong>drop-in/drop-out online co-op</strong> with <strong>up to 4 players</strong>. Coordinate with your team (or don\u2019t) to face challenges on your adventure! Of course, the entire adventure is ready for you to take on solo too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/0844f90a2dae5ab539dd15dfc08f7059.poster.avif?t=1746428867\" width=426 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/0844f90a2dae5ab539dd15dfc08f7059.webm?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/0844f90a2dae5ab539dd15dfc08f7059.mp4?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MOVEMENT &amp; UNIQUE ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grapple anything (including your friends), master aerial movement, and soar through a vibrant and mysterious world. With your glowy companion, assimilate abilities like time manipulation, teleportation,<i> the Gun </i>\ud83d\udd2b, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/96550cd748167f6d5f3c50840490888b.poster.avif?t=1746428867\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/96550cd748167f6d5f3c50840490888b.webm?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/96550cd748167f6d5f3c50840490888b.mp4?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE MYSTERIOUS AND STRANGE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse landscapes, from serene floating islands to corrupted, dangerous swamps. Each level presents unique environmental challenges, hidden pathways, and fun secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/4f9a3dff8e23a4214ffdbead3ee3d3cc.poster.avif?t=1746428867\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/4f9a3dff8e23a4214ffdbead3ee3d3cc.webm?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/4f9a3dff8e23a4214ffdbead3ee3d3cc.mp4?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER COLOSSAL BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>massive bosses!</strong> Put your solo skills to the test, or bring friends and see if teamwork and coordination can overcome the odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/6ad4b8471a05bfac47e2c8b6a2aee149.poster.avif?t=1746428867\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/6ad4b8471a05bfac47e2c8b6a2aee149.webm?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/6ad4b8471a05bfac47e2c8b6a2aee149.mp4?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER TREASURES &amp; COLLECTIBLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoveries await the curious! Hunt hidden chests for <strong>over 100+ unique collectibles</strong>. Find stylish hats, pets, dyes, and powerful relics to customize your monkey and make your mark.<br><br>From the developers of the cult\u2011classic freebie <i>Obama (2022)</i>, <strong><i>A Monkey's Adventure</i></strong> may finally  solve the unanswered questions laid out all those years ago...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grapple, swing, and soar through A Monkey's Adventure! </strong>Master fluid 3D platforming, battle colossal bosses, and customize your monkey with unique powers and stylish gear. Take on the adventure solo or team up with up to three friends for chaotic online co-op!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM UP FOR ADVENTURE (1-4 ONLINE CO-OP)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your team! Jump into seamless <strong>drop-in/drop-out online co-op</strong> with <strong>up to 4 players</strong>. Coordinate with your team (or don\u2019t) to face challenges on your adventure! Of course, the entire adventure is ready for you to take on solo too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/0844f90a2dae5ab539dd15dfc08f7059.poster.avif?t=1746428867\" width=426 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/0844f90a2dae5ab539dd15dfc08f7059.webm?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/0844f90a2dae5ab539dd15dfc08f7059.mp4?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MOVEMENT &amp; UNIQUE ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grapple anything (including your friends), master aerial movement, and soar through a vibrant and mysterious world. With your glowy companion, assimilate abilities like time manipulation, teleportation,<i> the Gun </i>\ud83d\udd2b, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/96550cd748167f6d5f3c50840490888b.poster.avif?t=1746428867\" width=426 heigh