428867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391470/extras/6ad4b8471a05bfac47e2c8b6a2aee149.mp4?t=1746428867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER TREASURES &amp; COLLECTIBLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoveries await the curious! Hunt hidden chests for <strong>over 100+ unique collectibles</strong>. Find stylish hats, pets, dyes, and powerful relics to customize your monkey and make your mark.<br><br>From the developers of the cult\u2011classic freebie <i>Obama (2022)</i>, <strong><i>A Monkey's Adventure</i></strong> may finally  solve the unanswered questions laid out all those years ago...</p>",
